  },
  "regions": [
    {
      "region_idx": 0,
      "first_idx": 0,
      "last_idx": 29,
      "text": "Four score and seven years ago our fathers brought forth on this continent a new nation, conceived in Liberty, and dedicated to the proposition that all men are created equal.",
      "n_words": 30,
      "n_aligned": 30,
      "start": 1.461,
      "end": 12.566,
      "speech_rate_wps": 2.701,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.042
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 1,
      "first_idx": 30,
      "last_idx": 53,
      "text": "Now we are engaged in a great civil war, testing whether that nation, or any nation so conceived and so dedicated, can long endure.",
      "n_words": 24,
      "n_aligned": 24,
      "start": 13.286,
      "end": 21.95,
      "speech_rate_wps": 2.77,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.299
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 2,
      "first_idx": 54,
      "last_idx": 63,
      "text": "We are met on a great battlefield of that war.",
      "n_words": 10,
      "n_aligned": 10,
      "start": 22.411,
      "end": 24.932,
      "speech_rate_wps": 3.967,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 5.491
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 3,
      "first_idx": 64,
      "last_idx": 90,
      "text": "We have come to dedicate a portion of that field as a final resting place for those who here gave their lives that that nation might live.",
      "n_words": 27,
      "n_aligned": 27,
      "start": 25.612,
      "end": 34.056,
      "speech_rate_wps": 3.198,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.872
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 4,
      "first_idx": 91,
      "last_idx": 101,
      "text": "It is altogether fitting and proper that we should do this.",
      "n_words": 11,
      "n_aligned": 11,
      "start": 34.656,
      "end": 37.878,
      "speech_rate_wps": 3.414,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.739
    },
    {
      "region_idx": 5,
      "first_idx": 102,
      "last_idx": 117,
      "text": "But, in a larger sense, we cannot dedicate, we cannot consecrate, we cannot hallow this ground.",
      "n_words": 16,
      "n_aligned": 16,
      "start": 38.838,
      "end": 44.341,
      "speech_rate_wps": 2.908,
      "articulation_rate_wps": 4.122
    }
  ],
